 "before_ingredients_html": "<div class=\"note\"><h3>Simplified version</h3><p>Use a jar labelled grilled aubergine, drain well and omit tomato paste and garnish. Alternatively use 400–450 g ready-to-eat aubergine–yoghurt dip for two, replacing both aubergine and yoghurt. Skip extra garlic and salt at first, then taste and adjust.</p></div>",
