 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Roast two whole pierced aubergines at <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"220\" data-s=\"0\">220 °C</span> for 35–50 minutes until collapsed and fully soft.</li><li>Cool enough to handle, peel and drain; use <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"250\" data-s=\"0\">250 g</span> flesh.</li><li>This adds time and needs an oven, so it is not the galley method.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "From scratch at home"
  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Make the core ingredient list first.</li><li>Optional additions are separate; each is called out where it enters.</li><li>Quantities serve two.</li><li>Cook meat and seafood just before eating; keep dairy and raw ingredients refrigerated at <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"0\" data-b=\"4\" data-s=\"0\">0–4 °C</span>.</li><li>Prep vegetables before raw meat or use a separate board and clean tools.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Core and optional"
  }
 ],
