  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Drain the ready-grilled aubergine in a sieve for 5 minutes.</li><li>Chop into a soft coarse mash, not a watery purée.</li><li>Use <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"250\" data-s=\"0\">250 g</span> drained flesh; weigh after draining.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
