  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Stir yoghurt with garlic and half the salt.</li><li>Warm aubergine gently in a small pan for 2 minutes; take off the heat and fold into yoghurt.</li><li>Keep warm, not bubbling: boiling can split the yoghurt.</li><li>Divide between two plates.</li></ul>",
