   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Melt butter over medium-high heat.</li><li>Add mince in a thin layer; leave 2 minutes, then break into small <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> pieces and turn.</li><li>Cook 5–7 minutes total, until browned and <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"71\" data-s=\"0\">71 °C</span></b>.</li><li>If using tomato paste, stir it in for the last minute; optional chilli goes in for the last 20 seconds.</li></ul>",
